  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine bread crumbs, coconut, sugar, and cinnamon in a bowl. Beat egg white in a small bowl until frothy. Dip 1 banana piece into beaten egg white; press into bread crumb mixture to coat. Place breaded banana piece, unstacked, on the prepared baking sheet. Repeat with remaining banana pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
